<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-26T12:56:39.717Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:56:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthis launched retaliatory strikes on two Saudi ports on the Red Sea and hit Saudi Arabia’s largest oil refinery, producing a plume of black smoke visible from space, while also targeting a financial district in Riyadh. Saudi forces intercepted drones and missiles over the Red Sea and western Yemen in response to the attacks. The intensified Houthi operations have raised concerns about worsening the humanitarian crisis at Hodeidah port. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOUFJKcTlSNmZHYWt2WWZqdWxWTzhVX3Vqakhma0tlMlhBOWMtczBfOHdlMllydUdjTldlTlZwcFk3UmJNMGVqaHk3NzUyUEpKTGIzaVJOb0FZN3VBSzAtcW1hT3RCcE1hU1o4bmEwb1B6aGxpa0Q1QUFCbGJIbVdTdUpmcGhCcWZLdzl1OVlCQ0JHVHk2UzMzMl9YOGoxZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPMGxmNWpoU2REQ2tGWWdWT3BEcUtvMm9PMTl3U0hkSTlKeWhDZkJnUDIwMkFPMEF5ZnNYdzl4OW5idWJaVVpfNUpmYVEzaG1majIzU1FWbWZRME00dnFCMFg1SHd5c3hCRW1CbWs2OU9KSXBDdGFFUEdydUtXS1VldGNzNkJmTlRQbGQ1d2hWR241RW4tcnVtT0ZGcUtMakdDbzRxdmczVFZ6VHNualE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxOR1VYSkV6czVycUFWd0t1bDdZMWhuY05hV3RuYjhjVnhrSXZfdXBfd1VDRjZzaFJOYnlGNDhiWDhIeTBIQV9oMGZOaTJQNmlMdll1a285bDkyYmgyVEVvTkVfcG5XNEV2Nzg5d19VbzBlTmxBeE1YeWgzd0ZwWHR3REYwTzBXS1dyc3l6R3FGUVdxU29objAwM1o3Zl9MdjJBRzN5Y3BBMjVrR0o1TkswQXRxMjkydw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTFB3a0lzeG9mSVFGcU44R2g0YzBxYjBxbmRpQnNNa2pRQUpIRVAyVWd4VkdUbUM0NmFlRWJHcUtkRnZjajZZb3RJYlhLc0JLbnB6RDFWY3JwZVVjSERKRmlFeFBQb0N